OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FSister Abbey leads the team
OL,7,     Fthrough a flood of cases,
OL,8,     Fincluding a patient with
OL,9,     Fcellulitis, an injury after being
OL,10,     Fthrown from a horse, and a toddler
OL,11,     Fwith a head wound.
OL,12,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FHigh-octane medical emergencies
OL,14,     Finclude a man found collapsed in a
OL,15,     Fhotel room, a head-on collision
OL,16,     Fbetween two motorcyclists, and an
OL,17,     F11-year-old who's taken a tumble
OL,18,     Ffrom his scooter.
