OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FBirmingham, Norwich, and Maidstone
OL,7,     FA&E teams face intense challenges,
OL,8,     Ffrom gunshot wounds to heart
OL,9,     Femergencies and assaults, showing
OL,10,     Ftheir resilience under pressure.
OL,11,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FInsight at a specialist clinic
OL,13,     Fwhere a team of top dermatologists
OL,14,     Ftreats a range of conditions.
OL,15,G0000 Street Cops: Catching the Yobs
OL,16,     FA unit of armed officers are
OL,17,     Fcalled to a high street after a
OL,18,     Fbank customer takes his rage out
OL,19,     Fon passing street cops. And PC
OL,20,     FJosh chases down a potential drug
OL,21,     Fdeal in a park.
